WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.473 --> 00:00:01.704
- I'm a right handed person.

00:00:01.704 --> 00:00:02.610
- But for the next 24 hours.

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:03.980
- I'm going to be a lefty.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.313
(energetic dance music)

00:00:08.357 --> 00:00:10.075
I am so reliant on my right hand

00:00:10.075 --> 00:00:12.211
and my right foot that I don't know what

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:13.674
I'm gonna do when I can't use them

00:00:13.674 --> 00:00:15.009
as my dominant side.

00:00:15.009 --> 00:00:16.472
- For minor tasks like opening doors,

00:00:16.472 --> 00:00:18.271
brushing my teeth I'm fairly confident

00:00:18.271 --> 00:00:20.048
I can use my left hand pretty well.

00:00:20.048 --> 00:00:21.905
But anything that requires accuracy

00:00:21.905 --> 00:00:25.040
or dexterity that's where
I think I'm gonna struggle.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.443
- I already suck at doing
makeup with my right hand.

00:00:27.443 --> 00:00:29.765
My eyeliner takes me like 30 minutes

00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:32.029
because I'm so bad at making it match.

00:00:32.029 --> 00:00:33.132
So using my left hand

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:35.048
I'm going to have to
wake up two hours early.

00:00:35.048 --> 00:00:36.360
That's gonna suck (laughs).

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.730
- I'm excited for the challenge

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:41.313
although I am positive
it's gonna be awful.

00:00:43.024 --> 00:00:46.274
- So I'm gonna write with my left hand.

00:00:47.132 --> 00:00:49.023
I don't even know how to
hold my pencil (laughs).

00:00:49.023 --> 00:00:53.023
Okay I have no strength
in my fingers right now.

00:00:55.072 --> 00:00:56.837
I am not proud of myself.

00:00:56.837 --> 00:00:57.837
This is bad.

00:01:02.908 --> 00:01:04.470
- I'm not proud that it
looks like a two year old

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:07.094
wrote this sentence (laughs).

00:01:07.094 --> 00:01:09.869
- I don't even know where
to start crossing a T here.

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:11.564
Oh god (laughs).

00:01:11.564 --> 00:01:12.852
I'm proud that it's legible.

00:01:12.852 --> 00:01:14.780
I think you can tell what I wrote

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:17.225
but I also thinkit looks horrendous.

00:01:17.225 --> 00:01:19.954
(frantic rock music)

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:21.994
- Now the hard part is the eyeliner.

00:01:21.994 --> 00:01:23.875
- No makeup except the mascara

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:25.872
put on with my left hand.

00:01:25.872 --> 00:01:28.124
I hope I'm not blinded after this.

00:01:28.124 --> 00:01:31.291
- Oh my god (laughs).

00:01:33.214 --> 00:01:34.464
It looks crazy.

00:01:37.289 --> 00:01:38.206
Second try.

00:01:40.331 --> 00:01:43.094
This is not working this is hard.

00:01:43.094 --> 00:01:45.393
- I did it they're not totally even

00:01:45.393 --> 00:01:46.937
but they're sisters not twins

00:01:46.937 --> 00:01:48.342
just like my eyebrows.

00:01:48.342 --> 00:01:49.851
- I don't think it's bad actually.

00:01:49.851 --> 00:01:51.311
I think I look like

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:54.689
my every other day it just took way longer

00:01:54.689 --> 00:01:55.583
than it should have.

00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:57.267
- So I bought this new mouse

00:01:57.267 --> 00:02:00.123
that's a bit more ergonomic but I realize

00:02:00.123 --> 00:02:03.614
the way it's shaped is for
right-handed people only

00:02:03.614 --> 00:02:07.132
and using that for awhile
was pretty challenging.

00:02:07.132 --> 00:02:10.650
- Very slow process (sighs)

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:13.610
This is going to take all day.

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.236
Which part do I have to click on the mouse

00:02:15.236 --> 00:02:19.153
even the left and right
click are so confusing.

00:02:20.751 --> 00:02:21.842
- Oh my god.

00:02:21.842 --> 00:02:24.675
I'm not even kidding I
can't do it (laughs).

00:02:24.675 --> 00:02:26.863
- Is it really that hard?

00:02:26.863 --> 00:02:31.030
- I'm actually trying my
best right now (laughs).

00:02:34.645 --> 00:02:38.151
- Here comes the nightmare of my evening,

00:02:38.151 --> 00:02:39.651
So far not so bad.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.062
I don't think I'm doing a good job

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:46.115
but I'm not cutting myself which is great

00:02:46.115 --> 00:02:49.505
also this razor is probably
like 100 years old.

00:02:49.505 --> 00:02:51.409
My leg is feeling a little bit like

00:02:51.409 --> 00:02:52.756
I might have cut it a little.

00:02:52.756 --> 00:02:54.962
So gonna go check that out.

00:02:54.962 --> 00:02:56.680
(tranquil techno music)

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.235
- After being a lefty
for a full day I realized

00:02:59.235 --> 00:03:02.091
that my left arm is significantly
weaker than my right.

00:03:02.091 --> 00:03:03.565
- This was a good experience.

00:03:03.565 --> 00:03:06.142
I'm gonna go back to using
my right hand now though.

00:03:06.142 --> 00:03:08.012
- The lesson here is I need to

00:03:08.012 --> 00:03:10.763
one exercise more cause I
just don't do that anyway.

00:03:10.763 --> 00:03:14.444
And two maybe experiment with a few

00:03:14.444 --> 00:03:17.265
things ever day or week or month

00:03:17.265 --> 00:03:20.265
with my left side keep it relevant.

